}}The doors to the ruins are blocked off by fallen rubble. The [[ON:Dragon's Belly|Dragon's Belly]] crafting site is located just down the stairs from the ruin's entrance.

A copy of ''[[Online:Cheeses of Skyrim: Hjaalmarch, Haafingar|Cheeses of Skyrim: Hjaalmarch, Haafingar]]'' can be found next to the [[ON:Skyshard|skyshard]] here. A Word Wall can be found at the summit, with a [[ON:Bristleback|bristleback]] and a [[ON:Mammoth|mammoth]] fighting in front of it.
